---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy & your brief — The Opening" paper>
<main id="main" class="start-page">
  <p class="eyebrow">THE OPENING / PRIVACY</p>
  <h1 id="route-heading" tabindex="-1">Your brief.<br/><em>Your browser.</em></h1>
  <p class="case-lead">This preview keeps your working brief on this device. It does not send enquiries.</p>
  <section class="decision" aria-labelledby="draft-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">01 / LOCAL DRAFT</p>
    <div><h2 id="draft-heading">What stays here</h2>
    <p>Your selected feel, scope and project references, goal, audience, desired action, constraints, optional budget, timing and reference links are saved in this site’s local browser storage. A draft ID, revision and update time keep edits and exports consistent.</p>
    <p>There are no name or email fields. Text you enter can still contain personal information; it is included in your local draft and exports.</p>
    <p>The draft remains until you clear this site’s browser data or your browser removes it. It is not synced to an account or another device. An older saved direction note may be migrated into the current brief.</p>
    <p>If storage is unavailable, the editor reports a temporary draft. Those changes may be lost when you leave or reload.</p></div>
  </section>
  <section class="decision" aria-labelledby="motion-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">02 / PREFERENCES</p>
    <div><h2 id="motion-heading">Motion choices</h2>
    <p>Your Full or Light choice is kept in local browser storage. Rendering quality and an unavailable-renderer status are kept for the tab’s browser session, so navigation does not repeatedly retry a failed or slow scene. Browser session restoration may retain these settings.</p>
    <p>Navigation history keeps a project-image reference so Back can restore the matching view. This contains no brief text or contact fields.</p>
    <p>Your device’s reduced-motion preference is respected. Motion preferences do not prevent access to the work, case studies or brief.</p></div>
  </section>
  <section class="decision" aria-labelledby="export-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">03 / EXPORTS</p>
    <div><h2 id="export-heading">A file you choose to keep</h2>
    <p>JSON and printable HTML exports contain the selected draft revision, including its text and reference links. They are generated in your browser. Exporting or printing does not send the brief to Shusmoy and does not create a booking or agreement.</p>
    <p>Downloaded files and printed copies remain under your control. Clearing site data does not remove those copies.</p></div>
  </section>
  <section class="decision" aria-labelledby="hosting-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">04 / VISITING & LINKS</p>
    <div><h2 id="hosting-heading">Pages and external destinations</h2>
    <p>Render hosts this preview and receives requests needed to deliver its pages and assets. Hosting log retention has not been configured as part of this portfolio’s enquiry operations. See <a class="text-link dark" href="https://render.com/privacy">Render’s privacy policy ↗</a> for the provider’s practices.</p>
    <p>No analytics or advertising scripts are installed in this preview. Project source and demo links take you to external sites, which handle your visit under their own policies.</p></div>
  </section>
  <section class="decision" aria-labelledby="clear-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">05 / YOUR CONTROL</p>
    <div><h2 id="clear-heading">Remove a local draft</h2>
    <p>Use your browser’s site settings to clear stored data for this site. This removes the saved brief, the older direction note and local motion preference. Reload open portfolio tabs afterward to discard any draft still in memory. Clearing site data also resets this site’s other stored preferences.</p>
    <p>A verified contact destination and real enquiry service are not configured yet. There is no submitted enquiry record for this preview to retrieve or delete. This page describes the current preview; it will need updating before enquiry delivery is enabled.</p>
    <a class="text-link dark" href="/start/">Return to your brief ↗</a></div>
  </section>
  <p class="approval-note">Development preview · local data handling reviewed 9 October 2026 · enquiry delivery unavailable.</p>
</main>
</Base>
